                "text": "Today, I stood with House Democrats in solidarity against the Republican's \u2018One, Big, Ugly Bill\u2019 that will strip healthcare AND food aid from countless families in Ohio and across the country.\n\u00a0\nMake no mistake: this bill is inhumane. And the ripple effects will be felt by everyone.",
